  caseId: 0
  title: The Missing Design Award
  briefing: Last night, the gold Design of the Year award vanished from the display
    case at Kite Design Studio, just hours before the company's big exhibition. The
    case was found open this morning. Four people had a reason to be near the studio
    last night. Search the room, tag the evidence, and name the person who took the
    award.
  suspects:
  - id: X_grace
    displayName: Grace Wong
    role: Studio manager
    alibi: '"I locked up at 7:00 pm and went straight home." (No one can confirm.)'
  - id: X_kumar
    displayName: Kumar Raj
    role: Night cleaner
    alibi: Clocked out at 9:05 pm; security confirms he left the building.
  - id: X_lena
    displayName: Lena Ortiz
    role: Rival designer next door
    alibi: At a restaurant 7:00-10:00 pm; the restaurant confirms her booking.
  - id: X_aiman
    displayName: Aiman Hakim
    role: Junior designer
    alibi: At the gym 9:15-10:30 pm; the gym's check-in record confirms it.
  correctSuspectId: X_grace
  keyEvidenceIds:
  - X_K1
  - X_K2
  - X_K3
  - X_K4
  experimenterNotes: 'Generated from docs/cases.md by FYP > Build Case Scenes.

    Culprit:
    Grace Wong

    K1 X_K1 - Display case lock panel

    K2 X_K2 - Sign-in sheet

    K3
    X_K3 - Staff lanyard clip

    K4 X_K4 - Printed email

    R1 X_R1 - Cleaning
    glove (red herring: Kumar Raj)

    R2 X_R2 - Torn sketch (red herring: Lena
    Ortiz)

    R3 X_R3 - Sticky note (red herring: Aiman Hakim)

'
